# The 3DS port, stage 3.6: the skinning loop (trans.cpp Sk1Loop) multiplies and adds with re4_madds
# (re4_ppc.h): on the 3DS in float, rounded twice, without re4_fmaf's double (its results only go
# into the picture); elsewhere fmaf, the same results. A port patch.
diff -ruN a/src/game/trans.cpp b/src/game/trans.cpp
--- a/src/game/trans.cpp	2026-11-03 14:21:21.494529769 +0900
+++ b/src/game/trans.cpp	2026-11-03 14:21:21.634385436 +0900
@@ -2508,8 +2508,9 @@
 
